@9405 = ~The SPL resource resolved from CLERIC_HOLY_POWER is missing. Install or repair the final Divine Power spell first.~
@9406 = ~The SPL resource resolved from WIZARD_IMPROVED_HASTE is missing. Install or repair the final Improved Haste spell first.~
@9407 = ~SPELL.IDS, SPLSTATE.IDS, or SPLPROT.2DA is missing. This component requires the final BG2:EE / EET spell infrastructure.~
