@9411 = ~WEAPPROF.2DA is missing.~
@9412 = ~OHTEMPUS.2DA is missing. Install the Cleric of Tempus kit before this component.~
@9413 = ~C0PR#C4.SPL is missing. This component completes Artisan's Kitpack Tempus grant and requires Artisan's EEex proficiency system.~
@9414 = ~C0PR#90.SPL, C0PR#92.SPL, or C0PR#103.SPL is missing. This component requires Artisan's Kitpack proficiency permission spells.~
